      "created_at": "2026-08-06T17:11:48Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-06T17:12:27Z",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "Right `MSG_WITNESS_TX` makes the additional motivation incorrect. I think it would be fine to ignore MSG_WITNESS_TX announcements, but that seems like a bigger behaviour change that does not need to be bundled with this one?\r\n\r\nEDIT: Dropped the additional motivation from commit message and OP, i think the initial motivation stands on its own.",
